SUMMARY OF 1100 PM HST...0900 UTC...INFORMATION
-----------------------------------------------
LOCATION...23.3N 154.5W
ABOUT 250 MI...405 KM N OF HILO HAWAII
ABOUT 255 MI...415 KM ENE OF HONOLULU HAWAII
MAXIMUM SUSTAINED WINDS...35 MPH...55 KM/H
